    "name": "e-Solutions Payments - Channel API Tests",
    "description": "Tests for GET /api/v1/companies using channel-specific X-Api-Key authentication. Update collection variables if the local HTTPS port or test keys change. Unknown-channel expectation is 404; adjust if your controller intentionally returns another status.",
